  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2KI 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Naamani okogwenigwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naamani, omochiki bw’abasikari b’omorwoti bw’Abasiiria, nigo arenge omonto bw’engencho enene ase obosio bw’omonene oye, na omonene oye nigo amosigete mono, ekiagera ase engencho ya Naamani Omonene aete Abasiiria obobui. Ere nigo arenge omonto etuoni y’esegi, korende oborwaire bwa ukoma mbwamoriete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Engaki eyemo, ekero Abasiiria bagendete gosakora, bagoosa omoiseke omoke korwa ase ense y’Abaisraeli, na ere akaba ogokorera moka Naamani emeremo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omoiseke oria agateebia moka omonene oye: “Onye ndiria omonene one arenge koba amo nomobani oria okare agwo Samaria, omobani oria nanga namogwenia oborwaire bwaye bwa ukoma.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio Naamani akagenda agateebia omonene oye amang’ana aya omwana oria omoiseke bw’Abaisraeli amotebetie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na omorwoti bw’Abasiiria akamoteebia: “Genda bono iga, nainche nintome riruube ase omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Naamani akagenda akairera omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli chitalanta chi’echifeta ikomi, ne chisekeli chi’echitaabu chilifu isano nemo, ne chianga chi’omoyega ikomi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akairana riruube ase omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli riarikire iga: “Ekero riruube eri rikogoikera, omanye ng’a natomire Naamani, omosomba one, erinde omogwenie ase oborwaire bwaye bwa ukoma.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli asomete riruube riria, agatandora chianga chiaye, akabora: “Inee! Inche Nyasae inde? Inde nokobua kw’ogoita na korenta moyo, erinde omonto oyo otoma amang’ana ase ’nde ng’a ngwenie omonto obwate oborwaire bwa ukoma? Rigereria monyare korora ng’a omorwoti oyo nigo arigetie eriomana ase ’nde.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Elisha, omonto oria o Nyasae, akaigwa ng’a omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli otandoire chianga chiaye, agatoma omonto ase omorwoti amotebie: “Ninki kiagera aye gwatandora chianga chiao? Tiga omonto oyio achiche ase ’nde, erio nario aramanye ng’a omobani nare ase Abaisraeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono Naamani akagenda amo ne chibarasi ne chigari chiaye, agatenena ase egesieri ki’enyomba y’Elisha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha agatoma omonto asare, akamoteebia “Genda bwesibie ase orooche rwa Yorodani ara gatano na kabere, na omobere oo noirane obe buna orenge ritang’ani, naye nocheneke.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naamani akagechigwa; erio akagenda, ogoteeba: “Rora nigo narengereria ng’a ere nigo arenge gosoka gocha ase ’nde, atenene asabe ase erieta ri’Omonene, Nyasae oye, naende abeeke okoboko kwaye igoro ase ndwarete, na agwenie oborwaire bwane bwa ukoma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inee! Chindooche chia Damesiki, Abana na Faripari, tichiri chingiya kobua chindooche chi’ense y’Abaisraeli? Inee! Tinarenge gwesibia ase chirochio ncheneke?” Bono akaonchoka akagenda ore nokogechigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende abasomba baye bakamochiera, bakamoteebia: “Tata, onye omobani oyo nagoteebia okore egento kere egekong’u, Inee, tikwarenge kogekora? Korende bono, nase ki otakomoigwera ekero agotebia: Genda bwesibie, naye nocheneke?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio agatirimboka, agasoa ase orooche rwa Yorodani ara gatano na kabere, buna omonto oria o Nyasae amotebetie. Omobere oye okairanerana okaba buna oyo bw’omwana omoke, ere agacheneka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akairana ase omonto oria o Nyasae, ere amo nabaanto bonsi baarenge komo, agatenena ase obosio bwaye, akamoteebia: “Bono namanyire ng’a Nyasae onde tari ase ense yonsi, otatiga oyo bw’Abaisraeli. Ase ayio bono, koranche oire ekeegwa korwa ase ’nde inche omosomba oo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha agateeba: “Ekeene, buna Omonene are moyo, oria inche ngokorera, tinkoira ekeegwa nonya nekemo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Naamani akamosorora anche abiire, korende Elisha akaanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Naamani agateeba: “Onye taibo, nagosabire, tiga inche omosomba oo ’ng’eegwe amaroba aisaine chigurube ibere, chibarasi ibere chiranyare kobogoria, ekiagera korwa bono na kogenderera inche omosomba oo tinkorua ebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa ase enyasae ende yonsi, otatiga nase Omonene bweka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiga Omonene anyabere inche omosomba oo ase amang’ana aya: Ekero omonene one akogenda ase enyomba ya Rimoni gochia gosasiima aroro ogwesiirera ase okoboko kwane, nainche boigo ekero keria nyekumbe ime ase enyomba ya Rimoni. Omonene anyabere inche, omosomba oo, ase ring’ana eri.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha akamoteebia: “Genda nomorembe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Korende ekero Naamani arure asare, agendire egeka egeke korwa aroro,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gehasi, omosomba bw’Elisha omonto oria o Nyasae, agateeba: “Rigereria, omonene one otigire Naamani, Omosiiria oria, ogendire, na tancheti koegwa egento ase ebio arentire. Ekeene buna Omonene are moyo, inche iminyoke imobwatie, inyore egento korwa asare.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo Gehasi akabwatia Naamani. Na ekero Naamani aroche omonto okominyoka korwa magega yaye, agaika korwa ase egari igoro, akagenda akaumerana nere, akamobooria: “Mang’ana ki aba?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gehasi akamoiraneria: “Amang’ana onsi namaya. Omonene one nigo antoma ng’a bono iga aborokigwa babere b’ababani bachire korwa ense y’ebigoro y’Efraimu, koranche obae etalanta eyemo y’efeta, ne chianga chi’omoyega ibere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naamani akamoteebia: “Koranche oire chitalanta ibere.” Igo akamosorora, akamosibera chitalanta ibere chi’echifeta ase emebuko ebere, akamoa ne chianga ibere, agatweka abasomba baye babere. Barabwo bakabibogoria, bagatang’ana bosio bwa Gehasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero baigete agwo ase ekegoro, Gehasi akabirusia korwa ase amaboko abo, akabibeeka nyomba ime. Erio agatiga abanto baria bakagenda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agasoa nyomba, agatenena ase obosio bw’omonene oye Elisha, nere akamobooria: “Gehasi, ng’ai gese kwarenge?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ere akairaneria: “Inche omosomba oo tinagendete aande.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
